            </note>
            <note corresp="#d293-f2" n="2" xml:id="d293-f2-content">
                <p>Attached at Tab B, but not printed, was Richardson’s April 3 memorandum requesting $5.8 million in grant
                    military assistance to Indonesia.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d293-f3" n="3" xml:id="d293-f3-content">
