            </note>
            <note corresp="#d293-f4" n="4" xml:id="d293-f4-content">
                <p>Attached at Tab A, but not printed, was Presidential Determination No. 70–8, May
                    18, authorizing the grant assistance Richardson had requested.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
